    "chunk_text": "\u00feam gefeohte werd, and Iudas eft \u00f0a spr\u00e6c to eallum his geferum, Beo\u00f0 Beo\u00f0 gemyndige hu mihtiglice he ahredde ure f\u00e6deras iu wi\u00f0 Pharao \u00feone kyning on \u00f0\u00e6re readan s\u00e6 Uton clypian to heofonum \u00fe\u00e6t God ure helpe, and tobryte \u00feisne here, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan tocnawon \u00fe\u00e6t Machabeus \u00fea geneal\u00e6hte mid lytlum werode, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ron \u00f0reo \u00feusend \u00fee him \u00f0a gel\u00e6stan wolde. Hi bleowan \u00fea heora byman and bealdlice fuhton, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan flugon to fyrlenum landum, and \u00de\u00e6r wurdon ofslagene sume \u00fereo \u00feusend, and Iudas \u00fea funde \u00fea \u00f0a he fram fyrde gecyrde gold and Eft on \u00f0am o\u00ferum geare geanl\u00e6hte Lisias fif and sixtig \u00feusenda fyrdendra \u00feegena, and wolde Iudas \u00f0a Machabeus micclum on God truwode, and ferde him togeanes mid \u00feam folce \u00fee he h\u00e6fde, And Iudas hine geb\u00e6d \u00fea and bletsode his scyppend, gebletsod eart \u00f0u, \u00e6lmihtig Israhela h\u00e6lend, \u00feu Hi slogon \u00fea tog\u00e6dere unslawe mid w\u00e6pnum, and \u00fe\u00e6r feollon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan fif \u00f0usend ofslagene, and \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Iudas to his geferum \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0a fyl\u00f0e wolde adon of \u00feam Godes temple, \u00fee se gramlica Iudas \u00f0a hine bewende and wan wi\u00f0 \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan, for\u00f0an \u00f0e hi woldon awestan \u00fea I",
